{"id":"430578","name":"西兰花梗酸","author":"harriet1003","authorId":"8268096","desc":"","cover":"images/430578/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西兰花梗","amount":"大约800克"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"4个"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"3匙羹"},{"name":"米醋","amount":"3匙羹"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜西兰花梗。","img":"images/430578/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用小刀去皮。","img":"images/430578/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净切成小块。","img":"images/430578/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用盐腌制。","img":"images/430578/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"半个小时，腌出这么多的水。","img":"images/430578/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"挤干盐水，放入冷开水里清洗。","img":"images/430578/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"小米椒洗净。","img":"images/430578/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"挤干水分，放入玻璃罐内。（没有玻璃罐就放碗里）","img":"images/430578/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"这个糯米醋比较好，是大米发酵的。","img":"images/430578/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大约800毫升的冷开水，放入3匙羹的米醋搅匀。","img":"images/430578/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入小米椒和醋水，盖上盖子腌制半天。","img":"images/430578/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"打开盖子，看到已经由青变黄了。","img":"images/430578/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入3匙羹白糖。（酸甜度看自己接受的口味）","img":"images/430578/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"夹出来，酸酸辣辣又脆脆的。","img":"images/430578/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"不能吃辣可不加小米辣。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}